{
  "name": "base",
  "type": "registry:theme",
  "title": "Manga base",
  "description": "Shared foundation for every mangacn item: ink/paper tokens mapped onto shadcn variables (dark mode is the negative) and one accent colour, --mg-accent (stamp red by default; presets via data-accent=\"indigo|pine|ochre\"), which also drives --destructive. Screentone utilities (tone-10/20/35/50, tone-lines, tone-cross, tone-fade-r/l/t/b, tone-frame), on-tone (paper plate for labels over tones), knockout (outline for heavy SFX), speed-lines and focus-lines, tone-shadow (offset screentone, never a blur), ink-fill, focus-ink, border-ink, shape-burst, edge-jagged, mark-error, a reading-rtl: variant for manga reading order (data-reading=\"rtl\"), a screentone veil for every shadcn overlay, and stepped 12 fps animations. Installed automatically as a dependency of every other item. Includes stepped keyframes for tabs, clicks, switches, dialogs and toasts; all motion stops with prefers-reduced-motion.",
  "categories": [
    "foundations"
  ],
  "docs": "mangacn base installed. Tones: tone-10|20|35|50, tone-lines, tone-cross, tone-fade-r|l|t|b, tone-frame; labels over tones go on an on-tone plate. Energy: speed-lines, focus-lines. Ink: border-ink, ink-fill, focus-ink, tone-shadow (positioned element). Accent: --mg-accent or data-accent=\"indigo|pine|ochre\". Manga reading order: data-reading=\"rtl\" + the reading-rtl: variant.",
  "meta": {
    "tagline": "Ink, paper and one accent colour, screentone, speed lines, stepped motion.",
    "usage": "<div className=\"relative border-ink tone-shadow p-6\">\n  <div className=\"tone-fade-b h-24\" />\n  <h2 className=\"on-tone font-letter text-2xl\">Chapter 1</h2>\n</div>",
    "props": []
  },
